== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Bird Cage|Bird Cage]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* The item's name is a pun: the familiar resembles {{E|The Cage}}, and it functions like Dead Bird, thus making it a "Bird" version of the Cage.

